{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>21歲日本AV女優瀨戶環奈有「千年一遇神乳」封號，她出道前曾1周打8份工，其中印象最深刻的是在牙醫診所當牙助，她坦言曾經性幻想過客人，無奈因為</p><p>瀨戶環奈會踏入成人展業是因為想挑戰自己的極限，提到遇過最的大的難關，她說：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094750045999104849076.jpeg/fiVZxhXtAciK94Tz7Ue2etesod5VjSkLr6utma-rrZk\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><p>更多瀨戶環奈的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887922322280448275106.png/Ra8cQpBOF2hrHriQAKeWuhj_9riBWKLQ1Qw7KtUMOyo\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095352863952896652137.jpeg/T3yl_Ux0ycf2luZKrFmhMvtGuboTeFLdlhTbFpYU2xY\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095355120619520819642.jpeg/CD81-C0_wt8_0yragYeClCGms0bjCvFURSnjkkUp45I\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095357360508928126035.jpeg/nyE9oFuc6Yu8LG2B03_3hI85fVFubHkeqjU0wqo1NMI\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095359545872384702159.jpeg/8ebvyAnZlRV_DTy1W0ZT9UavjFgiKHSw2V4uPtleLj4\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095361932562432823647.jpeg/oV9gjWeaZRJn19MK5IOELDtEJ9hHJudC7-IpL-_iKS8\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095351333031936978625.jpeg/FnvHnUNyHLTCTDp8v4PoMam-nWcLsp2JjyCcno8gnJ4\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095353610670080871532.jpeg/VgJdKmxwoL3yZt7OlAeY8t6ooFw1I9fMRh_sqEYf7Kg\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095355682787328153270.jpeg/O-zJ2E-A9ELUdJgpYNWsuOuTyVbjhjh7u3FrLbtxay0\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095357926871040819275.jpeg/EUQXHvM1CS8Fvrm9NX_qFLkZbS1WMmpyePxxuXj8cbk\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095360280006656248950.jpeg/z6BrdxEoD7HkhlJSwToxvmdCkbiBnJxIBGTr3gRk694\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（Instagram@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887922649436160419763.png/Tg8YCxnYkBo_py95F8jGzMGPLA1y4lfhFASvPhQErz4\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887924729942016862309.png/336mlqFajnzoA-WYMRbFWscYjNdmbESfOhyQHDockBw\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887924952240128578310.png/DWlOoT98Fc8KOk_15gKAGjLFvMyKUahZctqMhXLajIU\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887920275329024390156.png/IvBFPtZz-CAuzviOkuhST5uwt7_70AAMc2368XNt-vE\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887917649563648652748.png/KPhfMxgmjbrE1SzDIPZulUdlAdAIbJK5mh6YwZoemME\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887920006893568478605.png/OaCCqqsafzP6TioNj9YHFTrOwHKsP-YBImtEyCJrRMg\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887917859278848850713.png/RhSjzHHDQrhAurMoMzwcQPqo9fHjw7-M1Q-gtNUPoLQ\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887915199959040276058.png/8hWv6j_RpQLkrSQD4QA_-xtP9Zfk-w0PckfWWHJH1lg\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887915279650816794012.png/Iwi9E7_cAZ1IFbpkWJIbmVV8pb7vMkxGYLwlZGC8JWQ\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250521/1001887912494632960892674.png/WiPbimb48IwAWsMf6p6tgty1fUkQz4NuBx_FCwcfxQs\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈（IG@setokanna_）</figcaption></figure><p>從不擅長展露自我，到增加數以倍計的粉絲，瀨戶環奈笑說：「我有點強迫症，為了每次露臉的表現形式，我花了很多心思，像是每次發文要不要有小花、道早安要用什麼方式，都想了很久」。</p><p>而拍攝時的挑戰，她大方透露：「最近一部新作品是我被強暴的情節，拍攝之前我跟男優討論要怎麼強暴我，一邊討論我心裡就有種違和感，『怎麼會跟別人討論如何強暴自己呢』。」</p><p>她表示私下喜歡男生在床上強勢一點，坦言比起被動，自己更像小惡魔喜歡襲擊對方：「我都是推倒男生的那一個，比方說突然接近強吻對方，如果男生推開我或是用手抵抗，我就會一臉無辜說『真的不可以嗎』通常這樣對方就會立刻說可以。」</p><p>她最想演的情節，就是當醫生身旁的牙助或是護理師：</p><p>這和她出道前的打工有關：「我真的有當過牙助，無論是遞工具還是幫病患操作吸口水的那根管子，都很專業喔。」</p><p>提到過往打工經驗，瀨戶環奈害羞說：「我以前真的遇過很帥的客人，我就色色的幻想他，但是我沒有付諸行動，因為，那個人來看牙齒的時候，嘴巴裡面很髒，我就想還是算了。」她大笑說，因為自己當過牙助，很重視口腔健康，擇偶也會特別重視這部分的衛生。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129101100276781056528643.jpeg/EaYpq57z3_Vqcd-hRG2T03cafZ2mY6QL_fkBlf35AZU\" alt=\"瀨戶環奈非常重視另一半的口腔健康。（聯合新聞網授權使用）\"><figcaption>瀨戶環奈非常重視另一半的口腔健康。（聯合新聞網授權使用）</figcaption></figure><p>至於出道前做過最色的事，瀨戶環奈笑說：</p><p>延伸閱讀：前偶像練習生白石透羽下海拍AV　自揭「拍片為彌補當年不紅遺憾」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517252946923520572684.jpeg/siew79usq1l8Y23AAd_s3iVotRiUIJoBFL5YRxS-WEc\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：前偶像練習生白石透羽下海拍AV　自揭「拍片為彌補當年不紅遺憾」】AV圈競爭激烈，隨著TRE國際紅人展即將於七月展開，知名片商S1又為我們帶來一位話題十足的超級新人，未來或許有機會也來台與大家見面。（X@towashira14）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：前偶像練習生白石透羽下海拍AV　自揭「拍片為彌補當年不紅遺憾」】AV圈競爭激烈，隨著TRE國際紅人展即將於七月展開，知名片商S1又為我們帶來一位話題十足的超級新人，未來或許有機會也來台與大家見面。（X@towashira14）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517253295181824528916.jpeg/lGR7xGNv39BVKSzLMcitMQ6wKb36zXuIEVsDkBFbA5A\" alt=\"白美透羽日前透過個人帳號宣布已決定作為S1專屬女演員出道（X@towashira14）\"><figcaption>白美透羽日前透過個人帳號宣布已決定作為S1專屬女演員出道（X@towashira14）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517258731130880465932.jpeg/P6xEPi5pGpjd2YUd92E-lywXrgg38YxPmgJV45oCVeM\" alt=\"白石透羽（X@towashira14）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（X@towashira14）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517900174168064351902.jpeg/6vk9ckukn8oQjCteoaPS5D7xEDmExLbng3KsfoNyrH4\" alt=\"白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517902749601792576024.jpeg/dd2-bB_Hqum50KaSW-W7FxdeuEC9AE-xzXaoas12qGo\" alt=\"白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517904893022208489651.jpeg/1V7YERnogG13zS5qaPo_LkBbLzgh4rAfhJ1BJYSdQSU\" alt=\"白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Instagram@sexymatomegazou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517256478658560795814.jpeg/RPrQSaOzR_3nGGoBvi-gLHPwknsFy8gntCuwvrQrsL4\" alt=\"白石透羽（X@towashira14）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（X@towashira14）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517261801492480490523.png/QLTgY6x56YSg93R-0369LWQsdHkw7zBmahXiEmoV4hI\" alt=\"白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517264012021760849273.png/EzErXrNEwPBfKHB9_QdGuQ72VNUFOrvZRL_wIES_8CA\" alt=\"白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126517250757496832708623.png/zakINCpdAmEEOZewqj3-bBZDrO-hwJpI6EQgruhEIK4\" alt=\"白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）\"><figcaption>白石透羽（Tiktok@meronsuki1）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>拒絕塑膠臉！常盤貴子、仲間由紀惠同框送暖 「優雅老去」狀態引熱議</p><p>愛爾麗偷拍風波延燒！康康急撇清「我沒去過」自嘲：長這樣太浪費錢</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T16:03:22.744348+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1656,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}